Heya Everybody,<P>I had a fairly uneventful weekend.  Spent a couple hours with Verser inside Neriak Foriegn quarter killing some shadowknigts, then soloed there for a couple hours last night also.  The exp really sucks for some reason when I'm partnered up with Verser, even if I'm taking multiple mobs. /shrug  Sleethr joined me for a bit last night, and exp was better for me with a 54th level partner, then when i was paired with Verser, level 51.  I thought it was kinda strange, oh well.  Lownar is now 7 blue bubbles from 55.  So if anyone sees the following spells for sale, please let me know, or pick them up if they are pretty affordable, I've got about 2900pp, so I should be able to repay you.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>Spells:<BR>Levant<BR>Chill Bones<BR>Augmentation of Death<P>If I get online at all over the next few days I'll probably continue to camp in Neriak, I'm hoping to make 55th off these guys then go back to farming for coldain heads and cash.  I need to raise around 14k more plat to buy the stuff I am wanting.  Once I get everything bought, then I'll most likely concentrate on leveling Kalaan.  I kinda miss playing a level 50 rogue, so its about time for me to get Kalaan up to a respectable level.  He is currently camped out in Skyshrine, I'm not sure where to go with him, but I'll probably be looking for some exp groups in a few weeks, if anyone is still around 30th level.<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 54th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Bertox. Server<P>Sendil- 50th Level Rogue<BR>Solusek Ro Server
